Config is back. May 5-7, 2026, Moscone West, San Francisco.

Three days of talks, workshops and product announcements for everyone who designs and builds. Early-bird tickets are available through March 31, or until they sell out.

Early bird: $499 (regular $749)
Team packs (5+): $399 each

This year's tracks: design systems at scale, prototyping with real data, and building with AI in the design process. The full speaker list lands in April.

Get your ticket: https://config.figma.com/tickets?src=eb26

Can't travel? The keynote and main-stage talks stream free.

See you in May,
